      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>A flaming skull is shrouded in hideous flames. It deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6</span> fire damage to any unattended item it touches and on a forehead Strike. On a critical hit with a Strike, the target catches fire, taking <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> persistent plus fire.</p>",
