  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>More dangerous than simple severed heads, these skulls are wreathed in unearthly flames.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Beheaded are the reanimated heads of decapitation victims. These mindless undead fly through the air or roll around to attack their prey.</p>",
